  "historyNote": "#8739, eff 10-11-06, EXPIRED: 10-11-14 New. #12107, INTERIM, eff 2-21-17, EXPIRED: 8-20-17 New. #12431, eff 12-8-17; renumbered by #13327 (formerly Ch 403.02) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ch 400)",
